# pubspec.lock: this repo has never committed one for the mobile/ app
# (no prior commit has it, and it was not previously gitignored either —
# generating one via a real `flutter pub get` during CI-failure
# verification work made that gap concrete rather than just implicit).
# Committing it now would be an unrequested convention change outside
# any specific task's scope, so it's ignored explicitly instead of left
# as recurring untracked noise every time someone runs `flutter pub get`
# locally.
pubspec.lock

